<title>JAPAN: Tokyo Electron shares jump to 1996/97 high.</title>
<headline>Tokyo Electron shares jump to 1996/97 high.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Tokyo Electron Ltd jumped on Friday morning, attracting investor interest after lagging the recent rally in blue-chip high technology shares, traders said.</p>
<p>The share price of the electronics trading firm was up 120 yen at 4,510 yen at 0155 GMT, above its previous high of 4,470 yen and its highest level so far in the fiscal year to March 1997. Volume was 1.748 million shares.</p>
</text>
